elopment Cycle\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"></picture><div class=\"css-o76qu6 e1yv2nyc3\"><span class=\"css-6ox9jx e1yv2nyc8\">Blog post</span><h3 class=\"css-181a5b9 e1yv2nyc6\">The future is AC/DC: the Agent Centric Development Cycle</h3><p class=\"css-tlrqvx e1yv2nyc5\">The era of Continuous Integration, with its familiar processes and workflows, is rapidly coming to an end. Traditional CI relies on developers making small, frequent, iterative commits. Today, the “continuous” part is changing.</p><p class=\"css-1we3tt6 e1yv2nyc4\">Read article &gt;</p></div>","link":"https://www.sonarsource.com/blog/the-future-is-ac-dc-the-agent-centric-development-cycle/","retrieved":1772471774225},{"title":"The architecture gap: Why your code becomes hard to change","contents":"<picture><source media=\"(min-width: 1120px)\" srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/0fc80544-c636-4698-a956-5cb3164009c5/architecture_capability_blog_index.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/0fc80544-c636-4698-a956-5cb3164009c5/architecture_capability_blog_index.webp?w=352&amp;h=217&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"352\" height=\"217\"><source media=\"(min-width: 720px)\" srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/0fc80544-c636-4698-a956-5cb3164009c5/architecture_capability_blog_index.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/0fc80544-c636-4698-a956-5cb3164009c5/architecture_capability_blog_index.webp?w=720&amp;h=443&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"720\" height=\"443\"><source srcset=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/0fc80544-c636-4698-a956-5cb3164009c5/architecture_capability_blog_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=1&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 1x, https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/0fc80544-c636-4698-a956-5cb3164009c5/architecture_capability_blog_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70 2x\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"><img src=\"https://assets-eu-01.kc-usercontent.com:443/ef593040-b591-0198-9506-ed88b30bc023/0fc80544-c636-4698-a956-5cb3164009c5/architecture_capability_blog_index.webp?w=500&amp;h=307.69&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=70\" class=\"css-nm7ja6 e1yv2nyc2\" alt=\"Image for The architecture gap: Why your code becomes hard to change\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"307.69\"></picture><div class=\"css-o76qu6 e1yv2nyc3\"><span class=\"css-6ox9jx e1yv2nyc8\">Blog post</span><h3 class=\"css-181a5b9 e1yv2nyc6\">The architecture gap: Why your code becomes hard to change</h3><p class=\"css-tlrqvx e1yv2nyc5\">Stop the \"silent killer\" of engineering velocity. Learn what architectural drift is, why those quick code shortcuts lead to massive technical debt, and how to bridge the gap between your whiteboard designs and your actual codebase.</p><p class=\"css-1we3tt6 e1yv2nyc4\">Read article &gt;</p></div>","link":"https://www.sonarsource.com/blog/the-architecture-gap-why-your-code-becomes-hard-to-change/","retrieved":1772142951204}]}